Author: Nalin Arora [aut],
    Himel Mallick [aut, cre, cph] (ORCID:
    <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4956-2429>)
Maintainer: Himel Mallick <him4004@med.cornell.edu>
Description: Multi-view mediation analysis for MultiAssayExperiment data.
    Zentangler estimates exposure-to-mediator paths for every feature of every
    assay view, screens candidate mediators, fits the outcome model with
    multiview cooperative learning (agreement penalty tuned by
    cross-validation), de-biases or bootstraps the mediator-to-outcome paths,
    and controls the false discovery rate of the composite mediation null with
    an HDMT-style procedure. Causal direct, indirect and total effects are
    estimated by g-computation. A k-layer sequential route model
    (X -> M1 -> ... -> Mk -> Y), outcome-permutation negative controls and
    forward/reverse direction checks are included.
